# ROOMWISE — Premium Public Landing Page & Immersive Product Experience

## PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Create a completely new, exceptional public-facing landing page for **ROOMWISE — Adaptive Campus Energy Management System**.

This website will be used to introduce ROOMWISE to judges alongside its A0 academic project poster. It is a critical first impression. It must communicate the project's technical sophistication, originality, environmental purpose and real-world relevance within seconds.

The landing page must feel like a premium digital experience produced by a world-class creative technology and product design studio.

**Do not create another generic SaaS landing page.**

Do not simply arrange a hero, three feature cards, statistics and testimonials. Do not use a premade startup template with a different logo.

Treat this as an architectural, environmental and technology storytelling experience. Its central visual idea should be:

**Energy that responds to need.**

The website should communicate how individual classrooms can respond to their own conditions, and how those individual spaces can contribute to more intelligent campus-wide energy management.

Build the actual responsive React implementation, including its motion system, interactions, layouts and navigation. Do not stop at a design proposal.

